 Street corridor","notes":"Look up an all-ages-appropriate event before going, then use the theater’s directions from Bay Street or Walnut Street station to reach Seymour Street.","short_summary":"A Montclair performance venue one block off Bloomfield Avenue.","evidence_claim":"The Wellmont Theater lists its address as 5 Seymour Street and provides walking directions from the nearby Bay Street and Walnut Street rail stations.","source_url":"https://wellmonttheater.com/contact/","source_title":"Contact & Parking | The Wellmont Theater","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Box office hours are listed as Monday–Friday noon–5 p.m., plus two hours before showtime on event days; event restrictions vary.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"montclair-history-center","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Montclair History Center","title":"Explore local-history resources","subtitle":"Orange Road corridor","notes":"Use the visit page to distinguish museum tours from the research library, and make an appointment before relying on the archives for a research stop.","short_summary":"A local-history organization with historic-house tours, gardens, and an archives library.","evidence_claim":"Montclair History Center lists its office and library at 108 Orange Road and its Crane House & Historic YWCA museum at 110 Orange Road.","source_url":"https://www.montclairhistory.org/plan-your-visit","source_title":"Plan Your Visit | Montclair History Center","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The office and library are listed Tuesday–Friday, 9 a.m.–3 p.m.; public museum tours occur on scheduled dates and gardens are open daily 8 a.m.–dusk.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"m